{
  "name": "ondra-emotion-stage",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的七阶关系弧：敌意→试探→心动(3天,.18,.15)→占有(14,.38,.32)→病态(30,.62,.30且trust≤.55)→献祭(45,.70,.45且需sacrifice)→落定(60,.75,.70)。四闸防跃迁（时间闸 / 步长闸 0.06 / 只升不降 / 冲突锁覆盖为敌意），阶段是棘轮；关系三维带 §3.4 半衰期（240h/720h/8760h），熟悉度由互动次数推导。五阶段与六段 0–1000 为只读派生，病态与献祭不进默认 UI。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
